  data: {
    LLM: 'Avoid scoring penalty points. Achieve the lowest total score; when two identical cards are played to a trick they cancel each other for trick-taking (no winner from that pair) but still carry penalty points if they are hearts or the Queen of Spades.\n\nStandard Hearts: 13 each; pass 3; 2♣ leads; must follow suit. Matching cards in a trick cancel each other (no points). Queen of Spades 13; each heart 1. Shoot moon = 0 or pass 26 to others. Lowest score wins.',
